= Alfred Mond

Former Minister for Health, liberal MP and Big industrialist. Alfred Mond is a member of the liberals. Though formerly an advocate of the parties 'new liberalism' he has been drifting away from that as of late. His party loyalties could be up in the air.

He is an advocate of closer relations between trade unions and big business. Believing that such a closer tie could result in higher productivity and thus more profit.

